            "review_title": "Review at Buffet Poseidon Quận 11",
            "review_text": "Narith_CC\nPhnom Penh, Cambodia541 contributions\n0\nDelicious Seafood Buffet in Ho Chi Minh – Worth the Price!\nAug 2025 • Family\nI had a great dining experience at this buffet in Ho Chi Minh City. The food was delicious, especially the wide selection of seafood, fresh crab, clams, shrimp, snails, and more. Everything tasted fresh and well prepared. In addition to seafood, there were plenty of other hot dishes, salads, and a great variety of desserts to enjoy, which made the meal even more satisfying.\n\nThe restaurant itself is spacious, clean, and nicely arranged, creating a comfortable atmosphere for both families and groups of friends. The staff were friendly, attentive, and always ready to help, which made the overall experience even better.\n\nPrices are reasonable for the quality and variety of food offered, definitely giving good value for money. Just keep in mind that it tends to get quite crowded after 7 PM, so coming a bit earlier might be a better choice. Also, drinks like water need to be ordered separately.\n\nOverall, this buffet is a great place if you’re looking for a wide selection of fresh seafood, tasty food, and a lively dining experience in Ho Chi Minh City. Highly recommended for seafood lovers and anyone who enjoys a good buffet at a fair price.\nRead more\nWritten August 22, 2025",
